# PLAN-864 collections SOURCE profile — the 852 L/V rows as real-source
# executions through `ac-av/collections-source-run-v1` (frontend -> checked
# HIR -> shared lowering -> the frozen 822 execution, profile 4 unchanged).
#
# Every expectation is an INDEPENDENT hand-computed oracle (852 denominator
# values preserved; the source files stay byte-identical — new variants are
# NEW files, never rewritten rows):
#
#   L01  List<int> push/get               -> 42
#   L02  insert/remove/len                -> 42
#   L03  empty len + clear                -> 0
#   L04  List<Item> owned push(x.move),
#        checked read-only field view     -> 42
#   L05  remove transfers the owner out   -> 42
#   L06  get(1) out of bounds             -> trap av.trap.list-index (SEM-02)
#   L07  set                              -> 42
#   V01  Option Some                      -> 42
#   V02  Result Ok                        -> 42
#   V03  Result Err payload len           -> 3
#   V04  enum Number(int)                 -> 42
#   V05  enum Data(Item) owned payload    -> 42
#   V06  variant slot switch              -> 42
#   V07  Option None branch               -> 42
#   N01  List<Str> variant (NEW source):
#        removed.len()*10 + get(0).len()
#        = 5*10 + 1                       -> 51
#   N02  for-in over copy elements (NEW)  -> 42
#   N03  for-in over owned elements
#        with field projections (NEW)     -> 53

